Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:36:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1180/1252] HERESY 1168: the Creator's frames over the room; a
 Score card with no score holds only its from-the-sound button; the
 Librarian's star filter
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06.10.2026:
- «в комнате Творца прикрути на каждый фрейм — левый и правый — разворот этого фрейма на "полный экран", в оверлей окно
  95%x95%, с увеличением масштаба всего фрейма здесь на добрых 20%… кнопку переключения между фреймами. При запуске
  генерации — сворачиваем фреймы оверлейные. Retake — сразу в левый фрейм переносит». Compose and the take each get a button
  that lifts the frame over the room: 95 % of the screen above the player (which stays in sight and in hand), a fifth
  larger (CSS zoom, its own sizes divided by it), the frame lifted where it stands so its handlers and state stay its own.
  From there the other frame; Esc, a click beside it, another room or a run started put it back; Retake, Reuse and the
  score into the form bring the form's frame (show("compose")).
- «если нет партитуры, нужно прятать все кнопки, которые касаются сессии с готовой партитурой. FULL SCREEN, к примеру, не
  работает… Туда только кнопку "Сгенерить партитуру из звука"». A take with no score: the card holds that button alone
  (no staff tabs, print, paper, MIDI, markers, edit, full screen, nor the sheet the engraver left from the take before:
  its inline display is why the rule is important). The tools come with a score, its own or written from its sound; the
  pencil puts a score written from the sound into the form as the Full plan. And the button's row, display: flex, never
  obeyed its [hidden]: it stood under every score; now only where there is none.
- «В фильтр в Воркспейсах добавь Звезду»: ★ beside the thumbs, the favourites in the workspace in hand.

The new words in all six catalogs. The suite: 353 passed, 0 failed (9 new checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
